#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:1
msgid "Contributing Guidelines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:3
msgid "Contributions are always welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:5
msgid ""
"**Before spending lots of time on something, ask for feedback on your "
"idea first!**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:7
msgid ""
"Please search issues and pull requests before adding something new to "
"avoid duplicating efforts and conversations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:10
msgid "Installing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:12
msgid ""
"Fork and clone the repo, then `npm install` to install all dependencies "
"and `npm test` to ensure all is okey before you start anything."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:15
msgid "Testing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:17
msgid ""
"Tests are run with `npm test`. Please ensure all tests are passing before"
" submitting a pull request (unless you're creating a failing test to "
"increase test coverage or show a problem)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:19
msgid "Code Style"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:21
msgid "[![standard][standard-image]][standard-url]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:21
msgid "standard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:23
msgid ""
"This repository uses [`standard`][standard-url] to maintain code style "
"and consistency, and to avoid style arguments. You are encouraged to "
"install it globally. `npm test` runs `standard` so you don't have to!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hex-color-regex_CONTRIBUTING.md:29
msgid ""
"It is intentional to don't have `standard`, `istanbul` and `coveralls` in"
" the devDependencies. Travis will handle all that stuffs. That approach "
"will save bandwidth also installing and development time."
msgstr ""

